flowchart TD
    A[Scheduler or manual execution] --> B[IngestSources Map]
    B --> W[PaceDomain]
    W --> C[Fetch PDF and store raw S3]
    C --> D{Downloaded status}
    D -->|404 or unchanged| S[SourceSkipped]
    D -->|downloaded| P[Parse S3 object and validate]
    P --> H[Versioned DynamoDB rows]
    H --> J[CSV and JSON snapshots in S3]
    J --> K[Conditional active manifest update]
    C -->|error| F[FetchFailed]
    P -->|error| G[ParseFailed]
    H -->|error| G
    J -->|error| G
    K --> R[Report]
    S --> R
    F --> R
    G --> R
    R --> E{Any source completed}
    E -->|yes| OK[Success or partial_failure summary]
    E -->|no| FAIL[IngestionFailed]
